Cell["\<\
Do not attempt to plot  AppellF1 unless you have a several spare minutes! \
Search \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Why is AppellF1 slow?\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
in Google for an explanation. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.983869210887783*^9, 3.9838692321810417`*^9}, {
